{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The largest prime factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/0/21000c7e0dee8dd67ccc17cc8760ec21d81c5539.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999999999999$\" width=\"108\" height=\"12\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />. Determine the remainder obtained when this prime factor is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc34cdaf980a43433766990cc87ac60589a16f4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999999999999 = 10^{12} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"196\" height=\"15\" />. This expression can be factored with difference of squares and sum/difference of cubes.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/1/8d115ec9d6d8636cf2820c23196bfd5c49a077a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 10^{12} - 1 &amp;= (10^6 + 1)(10^6 - 1) \\\\ &amp;= (10^2 + 1)(10^4 - 10^2 + 1)(10^3 - 1)(10^3 + 1) \\end{align*}\" width=\"417\" height=\"47\" />\nNote that since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/8/058fc26221dd759dc08680de10e88836b24700ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^3 - 1, 10^3 + 1, 10^2 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"186\" height=\"18\" /> are all less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />, none of them are the wanted factors. The only option left is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/7/b876bfbf94c3daad3fb31c29d79ea32854bd2749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^4 - 10^2 + 1 = 9901$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"164\" height=\"16\" />. By doing a prime check (or noting that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e61ce09efe3f712dc81b4013adc833fb23dbb813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> has factors larger than 5, then the largest prime factor of the original number can not be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />), we confirm that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e61ce09efe3f712dc81b4013adc833fb23dbb813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is the largest prime factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/0/21000c7e0dee8dd67ccc17cc8760ec21d81c5539.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999999999999$\" width=\"108\" height=\"12\" />. The remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e61ce09efe3f712dc81b4013adc833fb23dbb813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84a5331a033295c6c5e8cbe4bddbde9e63ef99e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{1877}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"49\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t